alk on the record talking on the record  to reporters and elsewhere about Donald  Trump needs to move on it's time for  someone else  [Music]  but one trumped-backed candidate did  perform well among voters  accomplish more than anybody thought  possible  few and I have only begun to fight Ron  desantis's midterm election victory was  so huge that it is sort of Rewritten how  Republicans are looking at the  presidential race Suddenly It's Not Just  Donald Trump's nomination to to lose  DeSantis has not announced a  presidential bid but Trump has already  started attacking the Florida governor  is Trump at 71 Rhonda sanctimonious at  ten percent DeSantis Victory comes after  some Republicans have openly called for  the party to move past the former  president and look for a new leader it's  basically the third election in a row  that Donald Trump has cost us uh the  race and it's like you know three  strikes you're out there is a growing  sense of Republicans identifying more as  members of the GOP versus supporters of  Donald Trump following the midterm  elections some Republicans have said  that Trump's influence and endorsement  choices have cost the party winnable  races those who are most closely aligned  with the former president did  underperformed those who are talking  about the future who have managed their  states well they over performed other  potential Challengers for the Republican  nomination include Trump's 2016 running  mate former vice president Mike Pence  who parted ways with Trump following the  January 6 attack on the capitol  foreign  thing will be really interesting to  watch is how not just voters but the  donors the big money people and who they  put their money behind a lot of them do  want to see someone else Trump has a  proven track record when it comes to  online and Grassroots fundraising even  after leaving the Oval Office earlier  this year a Federal Election Commission  filing showed that Trump had more than  120 million dollars in cash across his  post-presidential political operation  but with the presence of other potential  front-runners in the presidential race  like Ron DeSantis it remains to be seen  where donors will invest their money  they are looking to someone else that  can kind of bring the party a little bit  back to where where it had been more  traditional kind of conservatism Trump  also moves forward amid a host of legal  issues including civil and criminal  investigations into his company Trump  organization the January 6 probe and a  federal investigation into mishandled  classified White House Records  [Applause]  Trump Still Remains popular with  right-leaning voters and allies within  the party but he now faces new  challenges that could influence his  candidacy ahead of the presidential  election he still is the number one  loved figure in the party among the  voters the base there now there are  cracks in that but Donald Trump is still  a very very strong and powerful force in  the party and that should not be  overlooked even as there are some cracks  and Rising Stars like Ron DeSantis  [Music]

